On DAY MONTH {{abbr|2441|2027.8 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, [[Prince Farem of Qym|Prince Farem]], then fourth in the [[line of succession to the Qymish throne]], and his wife, [[Zaja Miroq]], were the victims of a kidnapping by the [[Qymish Republican Front]] as part of the [[Qymish succession crisis of 2440–2441]]. 

